# Railway Deployment

## Services
- gridcheck-api: FastAPI Backend
- gridcheck-frontend: React/Vite
- gridcheck-db: PostgreSQL

## Regeln
- PORT immer aus ENV: os.getenv("PORT", 8000)
- DATABASE_URL aus Railway ENV
- Health Check: GET /health MUSS existieren
- Nixpacks für auto Build

## Environment Variables
- OPENAI_API_KEY
- JWT_SECRET
- DATABASE_URL
- FRONTEND_URL (für CORS)
- ENVIRONMENT (development/production)
